DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260701
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Case Search Identifiers for Maine eCourts
DESCRIPTION:Table of Contents \nCASE SEARCH IDENTIFIERS FOR MAINE ECOURTS 
 \n(Docket Numbers) \nA. MAINE ECOURTS - "GO-LIVE" DATES BY COURT LOCATION 
 AND CASE TYPE\nB. FORMAT OF THE CASE SEARCH IDENTIFIER (DOCKET NUMBER)\n1.
  Alphabetic Prefix - Venue and Jurisdiction\na. Civil Actions - Superior C
 ourt\nb. All Actions - District Court\nc. Criminal and Civil Violations - 
 Unified Criminal Docket\nd. Criminal Actions - Superior Court (Pre-UCD)\n2
 . Alphabetic Code - Type of Action/Case Type\na. Case Type Codes - Before 
 and After Go-Live\n3. Four-Digit Numerical Series - Year of Case Initiatio
 n\n4. Five-Digit Sequential Number - Filing Number\nC. TIPS OF FINDING A C
 ASE IN MAINE ECOURTS\nD. ADDITIONAL RESOURCES\nA. MAINE ECOURTS DEPLOYMENT
  - "GO-LIVE" DATES BY COURT LOCATION AND CASE TYPE\nThe Maine Judicial Bra
 nch is in the process of rolling out an electronic filing and case managem
 ent\nsystem to the state. The "go-live" date represents the date that the 
 efiling system is deployed and\nbecomes operational in each court. The fol
 lowing table provides the go-live date and case type(s)\nassociated with e
 ach court.\nGo-Live Date Court Location Case Types \nNovember 16\, 2020 Bu
 siness and Consumer Docket (BCD) Civil \nBangor District Court Family \nPe
 nobscot County Superior Court Child Protection \nMental Health \nOctober 2
 3\, 2023 Androscoggin County Superior Court Civil \nLewiston District Cour
 t Family \nChild Protection \nMental Health \nApril 1\, 2024 Farmington Di
 strict Court Civil \nFranklin County Superior Court Family \nOxford County
  Superior Court Child Protection \nRumford District Court Mental Health \n
 South Paris District Court \n1 of 9 Rev. 07/26\nhttps://mjbportal.courts.m
 aine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-087
URL:https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?
 strFormNumber=OTH-087
